{"id":1010204,"chapter_id":1010204,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"你和嗷呜绕着废弃的村庄查看，几乎叩开了每一户积灰的大门，却还是没有发现任何有人生存的痕迹。","style":3,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204001,"trial_step":1},{"step":2,"content":"贝格利没有跟着你们一起进入村庄，不知是不是因为不忍心让自己仅有的回忆破灭，他一直蹲在村庄外，守着那几朵小花。","style":3,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204002,"trial_step":2},{"step":3,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"贝格利……","voice":["vo_trial_10204_1_1"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204003,"trial_step":3},{"step":4,"content":"从不安分的嗷呜此时也不知道要如何开口告诉贝格利家乡无人居住的事实。她只好抱着狮头，一屁股坐在贝格利身边。","style":3,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204004,"trial_step":4},{"step":5,"speaker":"贝格利","content":"嗷呜，对不起……","voice":["vo_trial_10204_1_2"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204005,"trial_step":5},{"step":6,"content":"嗷呜还在纠结着，要如何与贝格利说话，没想到却是男孩怔怔看着小花，先开了口。","style":3,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204006,"trial_step":6},{"step":7,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"如果是为了偷狮头的事情，那算了，我早就不计较了。","voice":["vo_trial_10204_1_3"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204007,"trial_step":7},{"step":8,"speaker":"贝格利","content":"我……我不该说你是大骗子的……狮头的力量真的存在。","voice":["vo_trial_10204_1_4"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204008,"trial_step":8},{"step":9,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"可是……可是嗷呜好像没帮上什么忙。","voice":["vo_trial_10204_1_5"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204009,"trial_step":9},{"step":10,"speaker":"贝格利","content":"不是你的错，也不是狮头的错，是我的家……家乡已经没有了。","voice":["vo_trial_10204_1_6"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204010,"trial_step":10},{"step":11,"content":"贝格利的肩膀不争气地抽动着，眼泪一滴滴打在紫色的小花上。","style":3,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204011,"trial_step":11},{"step":12,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"诶，你你你别哭啊！","voice":["vo_trial_10204_1_7"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204012,"trial_step":12},{"step":13,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"可能他们只是搬去别的地方了，还没来得及来找你呢！","voice":["vo_trial_10204_1_8"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204013,"trial_step":13},{"step":14,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"你看这里一滴水都没有，根本没有办法住人嘛！","voice":["vo_trial_10204_1_9"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204014,"trial_step":14},{"step":15,"content":"嗷呜习惯了被哄，安慰别人对她来说还是破天荒的事，临时捏造的借口实在有些拙劣。","style":3,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204015,"trial_step":15},{"step":16,"speaker":"贝格利","content":"我当时就是因为躲天灾被送去狄斯城的，他们搬走的话，除了狄斯城还能去哪里呢？为什么不来找我，又为什么不告诉我呢……","voice":["vo_trial_10204_1_10"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204016,"trial_step":16},{"step":17,"content":"贝格利抽噎着驳回了嗷呜荒唐的假设。","style":3,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204017,"trial_step":17},{"step":18,"speaker":"贝格利","content":"我不需要你的安慰……嗷呜的家乡不需要躲天灾，你回狄斯是因为你喜欢这里，两边都是你的家。但我们不一样……","voice":["vo_trial_10204_1_11"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204018,"trial_step":18},{"step":19,"speaker":"贝格利","content":"我不喜欢狄斯！我只想回家，比你更想回家，我只有这里了，可是……","voice":["vo_trial_10204_1_12"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204019,"trial_step":19},{"step":20,"content":"他有些木然地抬起头，看着风沙蚕食着故土，眼泪止不住地涌出来。","style":3,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204020,"trial_step":20},{"step":21,"speaker":"贝格利","content":"这里也没有了……","voice":["vo_trial_10204_1_13"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204021,"trial_step":21},{"step":22,"content":"嗷呜顺着贝格利的视线望去，看着眼前的空城，依旧有些茫然。","style":3,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204022,"trial_step":22},{"step":23,"content":"即便她在里面推开了每一扇空门，近距离见证了这里的荒凉与死寂，她依旧无法对贝格利的悲伤感同身受。","style":3,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204023,"trial_step":23},{"step":24,"content":"狄斯城的家里永远会为她准备着暖炉和零食，金猊乡家家户户都欢迎这个保护了商队的小姑娘。","style":3,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204024,"trial_step":24},{"step":25,"content":"她确实不知道失去家乡是什么滋味，半途遇到要抢星兽的大叔已经是她这小小一辈子里遇到过的最大困难了。","style":3,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204025,"trial_step":25},{"step":26,"content":"但她有一点点的理解——当初在狄斯城里孤单一人看着别的小朋友的时候，她知道这种心里堵堵的，有点想哭的感觉叫做孤单。","style":3,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204026,"trial_step":26},{"step":27,"content":"嗷呜转过头来，蔫蔫地走向你，一头埋进你的风衣外套里。","style":3,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204027,"trial_step":27},{"step":28,"options":["怎么了？"],"style":6,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204028,"trial_step":28,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"怎么了？","goto":29}]},{"step":29,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"搞！不！定！嗷呜的安慰没有用，居然还有我堂堂舞狮天才做不到的事情。","voice":["vo_trial_10204_1_14"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204029,"trial_step":29},{"step":30,"content":"看来又需要小场记来收拾烂摊子了？","style":2,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204030,"trial_step":30},{"step":31,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"知道还不快去！","voice":["vo_trial_10204_1_15"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204031,"trial_step":31},{"step":32,"content":"嗷呜声音闷闷的，听着很是不甘心。","style":3,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204032,"trial_step":32},{"step":33,"content":"我知道能安慰他的办法，但不应该由我去。","style":2,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204033,"trial_step":33},{"step":34,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"为什么？","voice":["vo_trial_10204_1_16"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204034,"trial_step":34},{"step":35,"content":"嗷呜从你的外套里仰起头，鼻头还有些泛红。","style":3,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204035,"trial_step":35},{"step":36,"content":"因为他是嗷呜的朋友。","style":2,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204036,"trial_step":36},{"step":37,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"……嗷、呜、的、朋、友。","voice":["vo_trial_10204_1_17"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204037,"trial_step":37},{"step":38,"content":"她重重重复着这几个字，用力点了点头。","style":3,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204038,"trial_step":38},{"step":39,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"对，应该嗷呜去！","voice":["vo_trial_10204_1_18"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204039,"trial_step":39},{"step":40,"content":"她又埋头在你外套上蹭了蹭，收拾好心情后对着你伸出手。掌心向上，摊了两下。","style":3,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204040,"trial_step":40},{"step":41,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"方法，告诉我！","voice":["vo_trial_10204_1_19"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204041,"trial_step":41},{"step":42,"content":"贝格利的眼泪已经被风沙吹干了，他拖着两道泛白的泪痕坐在紫色小花边，看着远处的村庄发呆。","style":3,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204042,"trial_step":42},{"step":43,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"我有一个关于你村庄的故事，你想不想听！","voice":["vo_trial_10204_1_20"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204043,"trial_step":43},{"step":44,"content":"那个吵吵嚷嚷的女孩又凑了过来坐在贝格利身边。贝格利没有搭话。","style":3,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204044,"trial_step":44},{"step":45,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"不说就是默认要听咯！","voice":["vo_trial_10204_1_21"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204045,"trial_step":45},{"step":46,"speaker":"贝格利","content":"……","voice":["vo_trial_10204_1_22"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204046,"trial_step":46},{"step":47,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"你知道吗，这个花叫珀利！怎么样，这个名字是不是很熟悉？","voice":["vo_trial_10204_1_23"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204047,"trial_step":47},{"step":48,"speaker":"贝格利","content":"听过……","voice":["vo_trial_10204_1_24"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204048,"trial_step":48},{"step":49,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"因为珀利也是这个村庄的名字！","voice":["vo_trial_10204_1_25"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204049,"trial_step":49},{"step":50,"speaker":"贝格利","content":"好像……是的。","voice":["vo_trial_10204_1_26"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204050,"trial_step":50},{"step":51,"content":"贝格利的印象也非常模糊。","style":3,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204051,"trial_step":51},{"step":52,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"那就没错了，珀利是这个村庄特有的花。很久很久以前，它们就开在这里了。","voice":["vo_trial_10204_1_27"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204052,"trial_step":52},{"step":53,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"它们不只是好看的植物，还是很有用的染料原料哦！","voice":["vo_trial_10204_1_28"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204053,"trial_step":53},{"step":54,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"你们村庄的人把这种染料推广到了狄斯，狄斯又把它推广到了全世界。","voice":["vo_trial_10204_1_29"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204054,"trial_step":54},{"step":55,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"现在还有很多地方在用珀利染色呢！","voice":["vo_trial_10204_1_30"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204055,"trial_step":55},{"step":56,"content":"贝格利听着这些关于家乡的讯息有些恍惚。这朵自己如此心心念念的小花，居然早就遍布在各个地方了。","style":3,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204056,"trial_step":56},{"step":57,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"金猊乡之所以叫金猊乡，是金色的大狮子的守护为村庄带来了吉祥。","voice":["vo_trial_10204_1_31"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204057,"trial_step":57},{"step":58,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"那你家乡的人用这朵花的名字来命名这个村，一定也是这些叫珀利的小花给他们带来了希望！这就是你们村的传统和文化呀！","voice":["vo_trial_10204_1_32"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204058,"trial_step":58},{"step":59,"speaker":"贝格利","content":"珀利，珀利村……","voice":["vo_trial_10204_1_33"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204059,"trial_step":59},{"step":60,"content":"贝格利有些喑哑地重复着这个对他而言既陌生又熟悉的名字，试探着触摸脆弱的花瓣。","style":3,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204060,"trial_step":60},{"step":61,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"它是村庄的希望，也会是贝格利的希望！","voice":["vo_trial_10204_1_34"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204061,"trial_step":61},{"step":62,"content":"嗷呜抓起贝格利的手，大胆的抚上花瓣。","style":3,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204062,"trial_step":62},{"step":63,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"你看，这样碰也没事！它虽然看起来瘪瘪的，但其实很坚强的！能在那么恶劣的地方，带着大家的希望活下来！","voice":["vo_trial_10204_1_35"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204063,"trial_step":63},{"step":64,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"珀利是超级坚强的花！珀利村是超级厉害的染料村！","voice":["vo_trial_10204_1_36"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204064,"trial_step":64},{"step":65,"speaker":"贝格利","content":"全世界都在用这种染料……那就是说！一定有人和我一样，带着这朵花去到了世界上不同的地方！","voice":["vo_trial_10204_1_37"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204065,"trial_step":65},{"step":66,"speaker":"贝格利","content":"有珀利染料的地方，就有珀利花，就有珀利村的希望！","voice":["vo_trial_10204_1_38"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204066,"trial_step":66},{"step":67,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"没错！到处都是珀利村的希望！你的家乡没有不在，只是变成一朵朵珀利花，开在了世界上的很多很多地方！","voice":["vo_trial_10204_1_39"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204067,"trial_step":67},{"step":68,"content":"两个孩子聊的尽兴，不约而同站起来，试图将这个古老的村庄看得更加清楚。","style":3,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204068,"trial_step":68},{"step":69,"speaker":"贝格利","content":"这些花会记得村庄的人吗？","voice":["vo_trial_10204_1_40"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204069,"trial_step":69},{"step":70,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"一定会的！就像嗷呜的狮头一定会记得嗷呜！","voice":["vo_trial_10204_1_41"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204070,"trial_step":70},{"step":71,"speaker":"贝格利","content":"那他们记得的人里，会有爸爸妈妈吗？","voice":["vo_trial_10204_1_42"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204071,"trial_step":71},{"step":72,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"会有的！嗷呜的狮头是从好几代老爷爷手上传下来的，它什么都记得！","voice":["vo_trial_10204_1_43"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204072,"trial_step":72},{"step":73,"speaker":"贝格利","content":"那我在狄斯要怎么找到这些花？","voice":["vo_trial_10204_1_44"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204073,"trial_step":73},{"step":74,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"为什么要回去找？眼前不就有吗？我们可以带回去，自己种啊！","voice":["vo_trial_10204_1_45"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204074,"trial_step":74},{"step":75,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"记得你问我的问题吗？为什么家乡那么好却还要回到狄斯。","voice":["vo_trial_10204_1_46"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204075,"trial_step":75},{"step":76,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"你说得对，我喜欢狄斯，喜欢这里的人！喜欢邻居的叔叔阿姨，喜欢黛伦，喜欢小场记！","voice":["vo_trial_10204_1_47"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204076,"trial_step":76},{"step":77,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"我虽然离开家乡了，但我现在一点都不孤单！","voice":["vo_trial_10204_1_48"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204077,"trial_step":77},{"step":78,"content":"嗷呜看着你笑了笑，拍拍手中的狮头。","style":3,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204078,"trial_step":78},{"step":79,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"狮头就是金猊乡的种子，嗷呜把它带到哪儿，家乡就在哪儿！","voice":["vo_trial_10204_1_49"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204079,"trial_step":79},{"step":80,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"我说它在狄斯，它就在狄斯——","voice":["vo_trial_10204_1_50"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204080,"trial_step":80},{"step":81,"content":"嗷呜在沙地上舞着狮头，毫无顾忌的大喊。尖锐稚嫩的笑声融在风沙里，竟变得悦耳起来。","style":3,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204081,"trial_step":81},{"step":82,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"它就在狄斯，我会把它带回狄斯。","voice":["vo_trial_10204_1_51"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204082,"trial_step":82},{"step":83,"content":"贝格利从沙地里小心翼翼地挖出一株完整的珀利，捧在掌心。","style":3,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204083,"trial_step":83},{"step":84,"speaker":"贝格利","content":"要把珀利种在有阳光的地方。","voice":["vo_trial_10204_1_52"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204084,"trial_step":84},{"step":85,"content":"他们笑着闹着，在这片荒芜的沙地上追赶、胡闹，直到精疲力竭才肯启程返航。","style":3,"background":1055,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204085,"trial_step":85},{"step":86,"content":"透过后视镜你看到他们一个捧着花，一个抱着狮头，昏昏欲睡中强打起精神继续拌嘴。","style":3,"background":1031,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204086,"trial_step":86},{"step":87,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"我的舞狮肯定比你的染料厉害。","voice":["vo_trial_10204_1_53"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1031,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204087,"trial_step":87},{"step":88,"speaker":"贝格利","content":"切，狮头都弄丢的人还好意思说。","voice":["vo_trial_10204_1_54"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1031,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204088,"trial_step":88},{"step":89,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"注意你跟舞狮天才美少女说话的态度，我心情好说不定还能赏脸教你一段绝活。","voice":["vo_trial_10204_1_55"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1031,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204089,"trial_step":89},{"step":90,"speaker":"贝格利","content":"才不需要，种花做染料也很忙的。","voice":["vo_trial_10204_1_56"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1031,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204090,"trial_step":90},{"step":91,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"做出来还不是要给我点睛用。","voice":["vo_trial_10204_1_57"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1031,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204091,"trial_step":91},{"step":92,"speaker":"贝格利","content":"哼，那得看你出什么价钱了。","voice":["vo_trial_10204_1_58"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1031,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204092,"trial_step":92},{"step":93,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"我有最厉害的小场记，他什么都知道，珀利也是他告诉我的，你诓不到我。","female_content":"我有最厉害的小场记，她什么都知道，珀利也是她告诉我的，你诓不到我。","voice":["vo_trial_10204_1_59","vo_trial_10204_1_59f"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1031,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204093,"trial_step":93},{"step":94,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"小场记，付钱！我要给我的宇宙无敌霹雳好看的狮头点睛！","voice":["vo_trial_10204_1_60"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1031,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204094,"trial_step":94},{"step":95,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"一点左眼金，金光闪闪；二点右眼银，银光灿灿……","voice":["vo_trial_10204_1_61"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1031,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204095,"trial_step":95},{"step":96,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"三点天庭，吉星高照，鸿运当头；四点狮嘴，天下安定，兴盛繁荣……","voice":["vo_trial_10204_1_62"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1031,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204096,"trial_step":96},{"step":97,"content":"贝格利不知什么时候已经睡着，嗷呜也昏昏沉沉闭上了眼睛，言语间掺杂着梦话有些含糊不清，怀中的狮头倒是抱得比清醒时更紧。","style":3,"background":1031,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204097,"trial_step":97},{"step":98,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"小场记……我记住了哦……","voice":["vo_trial_10204_1_63"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1031,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204098,"trial_step":98},{"step":99,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"那个词是……","voice":["vo_trial_10204_1_64"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1031,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204099,"trial_step":99},{"step":100,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"独……当……一面……","voice":["vo_trial_10204_1_65"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1031,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204100,"trial_step":100},{"step":101,"speaker":"嗷呜","content":"呼……呼……","voice":["vo_trial_10204_1_66"],"voice_bank":"vo_owo_trial","style":1,"background":1031,"log_type":1,"src_id":110204101,"trial_step":101}]}